      "value": 6261937,
      "evidence": "Lender-Terms.pdf p.1 'Loan ceiling' = lowest of LTV, DSCR and debt-yield constraints; no separate dollar cap",
      "calculation": "min(6,297,600 LTV; 6,261,937 DSCR; 6,997,333 DY) = 6,261,937"
    },
    {
      "id": "binding_constraint",
      "value": "DSCR",
      "evidence": "Comparison of the three Lender-Terms.pdf p.1 constraints",
      "calculation": "DSCR 6,261,937 < LTV 6,297,600 (headroom ~$35,663) < DY 6,997,333"
    },
    {
      "id": "sizing_annual_debt_service",
      "value": 500352,
      "evidence": "Lender-Terms.pdf p.1 (25-yr monthly amortization at sizing rate; annual DS = 12 monthly payments)",
      "calculation": "6,261,937 x 0.07990372 = 500,352 (monthly payment approx. 41,696)"
    },
    {
      "id": "sizing_dscr",
      "value": 1.25,
      "evidence": "Lender-Terms.pdf p.1 DSCR definition (NCF after reserves)",
      "calculation": "625,440 / 500,352 = 1.2500 (binding at the 1.25x minimum)"
    },
    {
      "id": "sizing_debt_yield",
      "value": 0.1006,
      "evidence": "Lender-Terms.pdf p.1 debt-yield numerator = underwritten NOI BEFORE reserves",
      "calculation": "629,760 / 6,261,937 = 0.100570 (10.06%; above the 9.00% minimum)"
    },
    {
      "id": "first_year_debt_service",
      "value": 500352,
      "evidence": "Lender-Terms.pdf p.1: contract rate 6.35%, interest-only period 0 months, 25-yr monthly amortization",
      "calculation": "IO = 0, so year 1 is fully amortizing at the contract rate; contract rate equals the sizing rate, so the constant is identical: 6,261,937 x 0.07990372 = 500,352. Actual first-year DS = sizing DS (variance $0)."
    },
    {
      "id": "cash_to_borrower",
      "value": 1959842,
      "evidence": "Property-and-Plan.pdf p.1: existing debt payoff $4,200,000; fixed closing costs $52,000. Lender-Terms.pdf p.1: origination fee 0.80% of actual initial principal; no fee capitalization/interest reserve/holdback",
      "calculation": "6,261,937 - 4,200,000 - (0.008 x 6,261,937 = 50,095) - 52,000 = 1,959,842 (positive = cash out to borrower)"
    },
    {
      "id": "stress_uw_noi",
      "value": 585552,
      "evidence": "Property-and-Plan.pdf p.2 sensitivity instruction: reduce total underwritten EGI by 5%, recompute management minimum, hold all other operating expense and reserve assumptions constant",
      "calculation": "Stressed EGI = 921,000 x 0.95 = 874,950; management = max(18,000, 0.04 x 874,950 = 34,998) = 34,998; other opex = 291,240 - 36,840 = 254,400; total opex = 289,398; NOI before reserves = 874,950 - 289,398 = 585,552 (stress NCF = 585,552 - 4,320 = 581,232)"
    },
    {
      "id": "stress_maximum_loan",
      "value": 5313428,
      "evidence": "Property-and-Plan.pdf p.2 (combined downside: EGI -5% and sizing rate +100 bps, cap rate constant); Lender-Terms.pdf p.1 constraint definitions",
      "calculation": "Stress sizing rate = 0.0735; i = 0.006125, n = 300; monthly factor = 0.006125 / (1 - 0.16010979) = 0.00729262; annual constant = 0.0875114. Value = 585,552 / 0.0625 = 9,368,832 -> LTV limit = 0.625 x 9,368,832 = 5,855,520. DSCR: 581,232 / 1.25 = 464,985.60; / 0.0875114 = 5,313,428. DY: 585,552 / 0.09 = 6,506,133. min = 5,313,428 (DSCR binding); decline vs base = -948,509 (-15.1%). Stress cash to borrower = 5,313,428 - 4,200,000 - 42,507 - 52,000 = 1,018,921."
    },
    {
      "id": "subject_lease_monthly_rent",
      "value": 3000,
      "evidence": "Lease-File.pdf p.1 sec.3 ('Base rent is $3,000 per month as of August 31, 2026'; no increase before 2027-09-01); corroborated by Rent-Roll.xlsx 'Rent Roll' G7=3000",
